program	exclusivity_dynamic_index.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `arr[i]` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `arr[i]` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_dynamic_index.saw:15:7"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |     f(&var arr[i], &arr[j])"
log	"     |       ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
